<!--
  The themed-icon layer (Android 13+). Same geometry as ic_launcher_foreground, drawn
  flat.

  Separate rather than reusing the foreground: the system replaces this layer's colour
  with one of its own, so a gradient here is dead weight that also hides the fact that
  it can never show. Keeping it flat makes the intent obvious to the next person.
-->
